# militancy for paramilitary / armed groups
# (covers rural guerrilla cells, urban resistance networks, 
# worker self-defense committees, and sympathetic military units)

(..0.05) Nonexistent
(0.05..0.14) Scattered — a few isolated contacts, no real organization
(0.14..0.24) Embryonic — cells exist but lack arms, training, and coordination
(0.24..0.44) Developing — organized in key regions, limited operational capacity
(0.44..0.69) Established — capable of sustained resistance, significant rural presence
(0.69..1) Combat-ready — a genuine insurgent infrastructure across multiple states
(1..) Vanguard — mass armed movement, the regime is fighting a war
